# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-only material
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Course reports, submission templates and the long-form design notes. These
# are kept locally rather than published with the code.
extras/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated measurement artefacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The result CSVs, summary JSON and figures ARE tracked: they are the data
# behind the report and let a reader see the results without a 42-minute run.
# What is excluded is the raw event logs, which are large (the key-server log
# alone is ~38 MB), regenerable, and of no interest once the CSVs exist.
*.log.jsonl
*.log
results/_probe*
results/run_all_full.log
results/benchmark_rerun.log

